OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers this evening, these most
OL,7,Fwidespread through the Trossachs and
OL,8,Fwest. Mainly dry overnight with
OL,9,Fisolated showers in the west, clear
OL,10,Fskies at times across Dundee and the
OL,11,Feast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIt will be mainly dry and
OL,14,Fbright with some sunny spells. A
OL,15,Fscattering of showers developing and
OL,16,Fwinds mainly moderate from the west or
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
